You can mention a variable twice--the parser figures this out. So you can write:
F1 =~ NA*V1 + a*V1 + b*V2

and then use constraints to limit the range of a and b
a > 0
b > 0

See:
http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/syntax2.html

