The covariance among the latent variables is fixed to zero.
The variance of each latent variable is constrained to be equal over time.

Model <- '
int =~ 1*LV0 + 1*LV1 + 1*LV3 + 1*LV4
int ~~ int
int ~ 1

sl  =~ 0*LV0 + 1*LV1 + 2*LV3 + 3*LV4
